    "title": "BOSS Money: Send Cash Fast",
    "description": "<p>Execute international money transfers with the financial speed, flexibility, and freedom you deserve. BOSS Money is the best money transfer app with 1 million+ downloads. Send money to recipients for cash pick up, mobile wallet credits, bank deposit, home delivery, direct debit, and more to come. We\u2019ve been helping people securely send money abroad for 10+ years.</p>\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf0e WHY 1M+ CUSTOMERS TRUST THE BOSS MONEY APP</b>\r\n<ul><li>Remarkable Money Transfer Savings: Transfer money for as low as $1.99, coupled with favorable exchange rates that help ensure your loved ones receive more with every transfer.</li><li>World-Class Money Transfer Security: We prioritize your money's safety using industry-leading technology, guaranteeing its secure arrival to your beneficiary. If any issues arise, we stand by our commitment to provide a full refund.</li><li>Peace of Mind: Track every money transfer and know exactly when your beneficiary receives the funds.</li><li>Around-the-Clock Service: Experience unparalleled money transfer service and support for you and your loved ones.</li></ul>\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd12 CONVENIENT, SECURE & TRANSPARENT MONEY TRANSFERS</b>\r\n<ul><li>Transfer money anywhere in the world smoothly and securely.</li><li>Your first money transfer is FREE!</li><li>Many delivery options, including cash pick up, mobile wallet, bank deposit, home delivery, direct debit, and more to come.</li><li>Money-back Guarantee to ensure your satisfaction.</li><li>Track your transfers in real time for peace of mind.</li><li>Discover new deals every month where sending money could cost you $0.</li><li>Easily resend past transactions and hide the ones you don\u2019t want to see.</li><li>Our transparent process means you see all rates and fees upfront.</li><li>See how much you\u2019re saving compared to competitor rates.</li><li>Send cash without a bank account or phone in our retail US locations.</li><li>Backed by IDT Payment Services, we have a legacy of trust and superior service in all financial dealings.</li><li>You can also do a lot more than international money transfers with the app, including sending mobile top ups to loved ones.</li></ul>\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcf2 SEAMLESS HASSLE FREE MOBILE TOP UPS ANYTIME</b>\r\n<ul><li>Connect to 300+ leading mobile carriers across 100+ countries, including top brands like Tigo, MTN, Telcel, and more.</li><li>Double, triple, or even quadruple your balance with special promos.</li><li>Easily recharge data plans from top providers such as Tigo, Digicel, Telcel, Claro and many more great brands.</li><li>Schedule recharges or swiftly repeat past ones with a simple tap.</li><li>Top-up directly from your phone contacts for added convenience.</li><li>The top choice for mobile top-ups to Guatemala, Nigeria, Mexico, and many more.</li></ul>\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\ude80 AN EXPERIENCE BEYOND THE NORM</b>\r\n<ul><li>Bring a friend and enjoy rewards. If they transfer $100 or more, you get a free $25 gift. For every top-up worth $5 or more, delight in a complimentary $10 gift. Use the Invite Friends feature in the app to easily share your referral link to earn effortlessly. The more you share, the more you earn via gift cards!</li><li>4.6 Trustpilot rating from thousands of happy customers. A testament to our dedication to you.</li><li>Seamlessly switch between the app and our website for a unified, premium and smooth experience using just one account.</li><li>A trusted pillar in the industry with over 10 years of money transfer service experience and 30 years serving the immigrant community.</li></ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Redefine your money transfer experiences. Download the app today and experience the convenience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BOSS Money money transfer products and payment services are offered and serviced by IDT Payment Services, Inc.(NMLS935577, MAFT935577), and IDT Payment Services of New York LLC, both licensed money transmitters (hereinafter jointly referred to as \"\"IDT Payment\"\").</p>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<p>Execute international money transfers with the financial speed, flexibility, and freedom you deserve. BOSS Money is the best money transfer app with 1 million+ downloads. Send money to recipients for cash pick up, mobile wallet credits, bank deposit, home delivery, direct debit, and more to come. We\u2019ve been helping people securely send money abroad for 10+ years.</p><br><br><b>\ud83c\udf0e WHY 1M+ CUSTOMERS TRUST THE BOSS MONEY APP</b><br><ul><li>Remarkable Money Transfer Savings: Transfer money for as low as $1.99, coupled with favorable exchange rates that help ensure your loved ones receive more with every transfer.</li><li>World-Class Money Transfer Security: We prioritize your money&#39;s safety using industry-leading technology, guaranteeing its secure arrival to your beneficiary. If any issues arise, we stand by our commitment to provide a full refund.</li><li>Peace of Mind: Track every money transfer and know exactly when your beneficiary receives the funds.</li><li>Around-the-Clock Service: Experience unparalleled money transfer service and support for you and your loved ones.</li></ul><br><br><b>\ud83d\udd12 CONVENIENT, SECURE &amp; TRANSPARENT MONEY TRANSFERS</b><br><ul><li>Transfer money anywhere in the world smoothly and securely.</li><li>Your first money transfer is FREE!</li><li>Many delivery options, including cash pick up, mobile wallet, bank deposit, home delivery, direct debit, and more to come.</li><li>Money-back Guarantee to ensure your satisfaction.</li><li>Track your transfers in real time for peace of mind.</li><li>Discover new deals every month where sending money could cost you $0.</li><li>Easily resend past transactions and hide the ones you don\u2019t want to see.</li><li>Our transparent process means you see all rates and fees upfront.</li><li>See how much you\u2019re saving compared to competitor rates.</li><li>Send cash without a bank account or phone in our retail US locations.</li><li>Backed by IDT Payment Services, we have a legacy of trust and superior service in all financial dealings.</li><li>You can also do a lot more than international money transfers with the app, including sending mobile top ups to loved ones.</li></ul><br><br><b>\ud83d\udcf2 SEAMLESS HASSLE FREE MOBILE TOP UPS ANYTIME</b><br><ul><li>Connect to 300+ leading mobile carriers across 100+ countries, including top brands like Tigo, MTN, Telcel, and more.</li><li>Double, triple, or even quadruple your balance with special promos.</li><li>Easily recharge data plans from top providers such as Tigo, Digicel, Telcel, Claro and many more great brands.</li><li>Schedule recharges or swiftly repeat past ones with a simple tap.</li><li>Top-up directly from your phone contacts for added convenience.</li><li>The top choice for mobile top-ups to Guatemala, Nigeria, Mexico, and many more.</li></ul><br><br><b>\ud83d\ude80 AN EXPERIENCE BEYOND THE NORM</b><br><ul><li>Bring a friend and enjoy rewards. If they transfer $100 or more, you get a free $25 gift. For every top-up worth $5 or more, delight in a complimentary $10 gift. Use the Invite Friends feature in the app to easily share your referral link to earn effortlessly. The more you share, the more you earn via gift cards!</li><li>4.6 Trustpilot rating from thousands of happy customers. A testament to our dedication to you.</li><li>Seamlessly switch between the app and our website for a unified, premium and smooth experience using just one account.</li><li>A trusted pillar in the industry with over 10 years of money transfer service experience and 30 years serving the immigrant community.</li></ul><br><br><p>Redefine your money transfer experiences. Download the app today and experience the convenience.</p><br><br><p>BOSS Money money transfer products and payment services are offered and serviced by IDT Payment Services, Inc.(NMLS935577, MAFT935577), and IDT Payment Services of New York LLC, both licensed money transmitters (hereinafter jointly referred to as &quot;&quot;IDT Payment&quot;&quot;).</p>",
